OL,3,GNEWSASecurity incidents at county
OL,4,Ahospitals on the rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FSecurity incidents at Shropshire's main
OL,7,Fhospitals have risen by more than 37%
OL,8,Fin a year, with staff facing
OL,9,Faggression, threats and abuse as demand
OL,10,Ffor support increases.
OL,12,FA total of 2,669 incidents were
OL,13,Frecorded by The Shrewsbury and Telford
OL,14,FHospital NHS Trust (SaTH) in 2025-26,
OL,15,Fan average of seven a day.
OL,17,FRoyal Shrewsbury Hospital accounted for
OL,18,F1,627 incidents, more than four a day,
OL,19,Fwhile Princess Royal Hospital in
OL,20,FTelford recorded 1,007. A further 12
OL,21,Fwere reported at Hollinswood House,
OL,22,Fwhere patients have blood tests.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
