OL,4,Ahospitals on the rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe total compares with 1,946 incidents
OL,7,Fin 2024-25 and 1,603 in the previous
OL,8,Fyear, according to the Local Democracy
OL,9,FReporting Service (LDRS).
